年，四方莫舉樂，以思堯。堯知子丹朱之不肖，不足授天下，於是乃權授舜。授舜，則天下得其利而丹朱病；授丹朱，則天下病而丹朱得其利。堯曰「終不以天下之病而利一人」，而卒授舜以天下。堯崩，三年之喪畢，舜讓辟丹朱於南河之南。諸侯朝覲者不之丹朱而之舜，獄訟者不之丹朱而之舜，謳歌者不謳歌丹朱而謳歌舜。舜曰：「天也夫！」而後之中國踐天子位焉，是爲帝舜。","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m017-0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"堯","kind":"person","person_id":"oho_r3f_c6y","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m017-0006","start":6,"end":7,"surface":"舜","kind":"person","person_id":"ddb_l4j_4j2","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m017-0015","start":15,"end":16,"surface":"舜","kind":"person","person_id":"ddb_l4j_4j2","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m017-0028","start":28,"end":29,"surface":"堯","kind":"person","person_id":"oho_r3f_c6y","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m017-0060","start":60,"end":61,"surface":"堯","kind":"person","person_id":"oho_r3f_c6y","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m017-0062","start":62,"end":63,"surface":"堯","kind":"person","person_id":"oho_r3f_c6y","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m017-0065","start":65,"end":67,"surface":"丹朱","kind":"person","person_id":"dpx_453_4rt","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m017-0082","start":82,"end":83,"surface":"舜","kind":"person","person_id":"ddb_l4j_4j2","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m017-0085","start":85,"end":86,"surface":"舜","kind":"person","person_id":"ddb_l4j_4j2","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m017-0094","start":94,"end":96,"surface":"丹朱","kind":"person","person_id":"dpx_453_4rt","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m017-0099","start":99,"end":101,"surface":"丹朱","kind":"person","person_id":"dpx_453_4rt","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m017-0107","start":107,"end":109,"surface":"丹朱","kind":"person","person_id":"dpx_453_4rt","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m017-0113","start":113,"end":114,"surface":"堯","kind":"person","person_id":"oho_r3f_c6y","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m017-0132","start":132,"end":133,"surface":"舜","kind":"person","person_id":"ddb_l4j_4j2","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m017-0137","start":137,"end":138,"surface":"堯","kind":"person","person_id":"oho_r3f_c6y","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m017-0146","start":146,"end":147,"surface":"舜","kind":"person","person_id":"ddb_l4j_4j2","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m017-0149","start":149,"end":151,"surface":"丹朱","kind":"person","person_id":"dpx_453_4rt","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m017-0164","start":164,"end":166,"surface":"丹朱","kind":"person","person_id":"dpx_453_4rt","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m017-0168","start":168,"end":169,"surface":"舜","kind":"person","person_id":"ddb_l4j_4j2","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m017-0175","start":175,"end":177,"surface":"丹朱","kind":"person","person_id":"dpx_453_4rt","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m017-0179","start":179,"end":180,"surface":"舜","kind":"person","person_id":"ddb_l4j_4j2","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m017-0187","start":187,"end":189,"surface":"丹朱","kind":"person","person_id":"dpx_453_4rt","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m017-0192","start":192,"end":193,"surface":"舜","kind":"person","person_id":"ddb_l4j_4j2","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m017-0194","start":194,"end":195,"surface":"舜","kind":"person","person_id":"ddb_l4j_4j2","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m017-0216","start":216,"end":218,"surface":"帝舜","kind":"person","person_id":"ddb_l4j_4j2","status":"source_identified"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-001-wudi","book_id":"b-shiji-001","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-001-wudi"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:p024","text":"舜入于大麓，烈風雷雨不迷，堯乃知舜之足授天下。堯老，使舜攝行天子政，巡狩。舜得舉，用事二十年，而堯使攝政。攝政八年而堯崩。三年喪畢，讓丹朱，天下歸舜。而禹、皋陶、契、后稷、伯夷、夔、龍、倕、益、彭祖自堯時而皆舉用，未有分職。於是舜乃至於文祖，謀于四嶽，辟四門，明通四方耳目，命十二牧論帝德，行厚德，遠佞人，則蠻夷率服。舜謂四嶽曰：「有能奮庸美堯之事者，使居官相事？」皆曰：「伯禹爲司空，可美帝功。」舜曰：「嗟，然！禹，汝平水土，維是勉哉。」禹拜稽首，讓於稷、契與皋陶。舜曰：「然，往矣。」舜曰：「棄，黎民始飢，汝后稷，播時百穀。」舜曰：「契，百姓不親，五品不馴，汝爲司徒，而敬敷五教，在寬。」舜曰：「皋陶，蠻夷猾夏，寇賊姦軌，汝作士，五刑有服，五服三就；五流有度，五度三居：維明能信。」舜曰：「誰能馴予工？」皆曰垂可。於是以垂爲共工。舜曰：「誰能馴予上下草木鳥獸？」皆曰益可。於是以益爲朕虞。益拜稽首，讓于諸臣朱虎、熊羆。舜曰：「往矣，汝諧。」遂以朱虎、熊羆爲佐。舜曰：「嗟！四嶽，有能典朕三禮？」皆曰伯夷可。舜曰：「嗟！伯夷，以汝爲秩宗，夙夜維敬，直哉維靜絜。」伯夷讓夔、龍。舜曰：「然。以夔爲典樂，教稺子，直而溫，寬而栗，剛而毋虐，簡而毋傲；詩言意，歌長言，聲依永，律和聲，八音能諧，毋相奪倫，神人以和。」夔曰：「於！予擊石拊石，百獸率舞。」舜曰：「龍，朕畏忌讒說殄僞，振驚朕衆，命汝爲納言，夙夜出入朕命，惟信。」舜曰：「嗟！女二十有二人，敬哉，惟時相天事。」三歲一考功，三考絀陟，遠近衆功咸興。分北三苗。","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m024-0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"舜","kind":"person","person_id":"ddb_l4j_4j2","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m024-0013","start":13,"end":14,"surface":"堯","kind":"person","person_id":"oho_r3f_c6y","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m024-0016","start":16,"end":17,"surface":"舜","kind":"person","person_id":"ddb_l4j_4j2","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m024-0023","start":23,"end":24,"surface":"堯","kind":"person","person_id":"oho_r3f_c6y","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m024-0027","start":27,"end":28,"surface":"舜","kind":"person","person_id":"ddb_l4j_4j2","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m024-0037","start":37,"end":38,"surface":"舜","kind":"person","person_id":"ddb_l4j_4j2","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m024-0048","start":48,"end":49,"surface":"堯","kind":"person","person_id":"oho_r3f_c6y","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m024-0058","start":58,"end":59,"surface":"堯","kind":"person","person_id":"oho_r3f_c6y","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m024-0067","start":67,"end":69,"surface":"丹朱","kind":"person","person_id":"dpx_453_4rt","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m024-0073","start":73,"end":74,"surface":"舜","kind":"person","person_id":"ddb_l4j_4j2","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m024-0076