,"start":165,"end":167,"surface":"商均","kind":"person","person_id":"mvm_6am_j2n","status":"source_identified"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-001-wudi","book_id":"b-shiji-001","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-001-wudi"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:p023","text":"帝曰：「毋若丹朱傲，維慢游是好，毋水行舟，朋淫于家，用絕其世。予不能順是。」禹曰：「予娶塗山，辛壬癸甲；生啓，予不子，以故能成水土功。輔成五服，至于五千里，州十二師，外薄四海，咸建五長，各道有功。苗頑不即功，帝其念哉。」帝曰：「道吾德，乃女功序之也。」","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m023-0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"帝","kind":"person","person_id":"ddb_l4j_4j2","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段與前後段的帝舜及對話敘事暫定為舜，非全篇所有「帝」的自動對應。"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m023-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"丹朱","kind":"person","person_id":"dpx_453_4rt","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m023-0038","start":38,"end":39,"surface":"禹","kind":"person","person_id":"6ip_dr3_fbl","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m023-0044","start":44,"end":46,"surface":"塗山","kind":"person","person_id":"t7k_3g1_qp3","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m023-0053","start":53,"end":54,"surface":"啓","kind":"person","person_id":"t4u_no9_s1q","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m023-0079","start":79,"end":82,"surface":"十二師","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、氏族、官職或未定指代；不推造個別姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m023-0090","start":90,"end":92,"surface":"五長","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、氏族、官職或未定指代；不推造個別姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m023-0098","start":98,"end":99,"surface":"苗","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、氏族、官職或未定指代；不推造個別姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m023-0104","start":104,"end":105,"surface":"帝","kind":"person","person_id":"ddb_l4j_4j2","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段與前後段的帝舜及對話敘事暫定為舜，非全篇所有「帝」的自動對應。"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m023-0110","start":110,"end":111,"surface":"帝","kind":"person","person_id":"ddb_l4j_4j2","status":"contextual_provisional","interp